	"Version": 1,
	"VersionName": "0.5.0-B3bis",
	"FriendlyName": "AInimator Controller Runtime",
	"Description": "Real-time NNE runtime for the AI-nimator deterministic autoregressive motion controller. Loads a controller bundle (controller.onnx + norm_stats.json + manifest.json + presets) exported by the ainimator Python export pipeline and runs one forward per frame, engine-side autoregression, engine-side normalization. Defines no model; behavioural parity with the Unity/Sentis runtime is required (ROADMAP_PLUGINS.md Goal B vérité #7). Includes B3 authoring (UAInimatorActionComponent + Details customization), B4 post-processing (foot-lock IK + idle/move blending), and B3-bis rig binding + prompt-driven pilotage (UAInimatorRigMap/FRigBinder/UAInimatorCharacterComponent).",
	"Category": "Animation",
	"CreatedBy": "AI-nimator",
